{"path":"/tip/06-26","title":"不要指望吃早餐或 16:8 轻断食帮你控制体重，吃饭时间挑你能长期坚持的 | HowToLiveBetter","description":"流行说法是不吃早餐会让人午饭晚饭暴食，一天总量反而更多。试验里不是这样：不吃早餐的人一天少吃了两百多千卡，体重还略轻一点。16:8 和单纯少吃比，一年下来体重也没差别。长期不吃早餐的人心血管病确实多约一成七，总死亡率则看不出差别。","lang":"zh","styles":["/sites/howtolivebetter/styles/bca54bebe9c1bd3b.css"],"bodyClass":"font-sans antialiased","nodes":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-site"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-header-slot","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[]},{"tag":"header","props":{"className":"life-header"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-header-inner"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-brand","aria-label":"H ✳ HowToLiveBetter 首页","href":"/"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-brand-mark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["H",{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["✳"]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["HowToLive",{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Better"]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-nav","aria-label":"主导航"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/book"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["阅读全书"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["精选 50 条"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/daily"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["每日任务"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/dashboard"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["我的清单"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-nav-link life-nav-more","aria-haspopup":"menu","aria-expanded":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["更多"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down","aria-hidden